{"seq":6,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值分析与计算方法","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods","rating":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 数值分析与计算方法：让数学在计算机上落地\n\n## 定位与边界\n\n数值分析研究如何用计算机高效、准确地求解数学问题。在理想的数学世界中，方程有解析解、积分有闭合形式；但在现实的计算世界中，我们几乎总是需要依赖数值近似。本 hub 提供设计、分析和评估这些近似方法的理论工具与实践指南。与同类数学 hub 的边界：「线性代数」讲理论框架与抽象结构，本 hub 讲如何在计算机上高效求解线性代数问题；「微积分应用」讲连续数学的建模与推导，本 hub 讲当解析解不存在时如何用离散近似获得数值答案；「微分方程」讲理论解法与定性分析，本 hub 第四章专门讲 ODE 的数值求解。本 hub 是\"数学理论落地为计算\"的桥梁。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共四章，建议按顺序学习：\n\n**第一章 数值误差与稳定性**——建立数值计算的基础认知：浮点数表示原理、误差传播机制、数值稳定性概念、精度陷阱的识别与规避。这是所有数值方法的共同基础——不理解误差，后续的一切精度分析都无从谈起。\n\n**第二章 线性代数数值方法**——科学计算中最核心、使用最频繁的数值方法：直接法（高斯消元、LU 分解）、迭代法（Jacobi、Gauss-Seidel、共轭梯度）、特征值算法、稀疏矩阵技术。几乎所有大规模计算问题最终都归结为线性方程组求解。\n\n**第三章 数值积分与微分**——当解析积分和微分不可行时的近似方案：插值理论、数值微分公式、求积公式（Newton-Cotes、Gauss 积分）、自适应积分策略。\n\n**第四章 常微分方程数值解**——用数值方法求解 ODE 的核心技术：欧拉法、龙格-库塔法（RK4）、多步法、刚性方程的特殊处理（隐式方法、BDF），以及在物理仿真、控制系统等场景的应用。\n\n第一章是后续所有章节的前置基础；第二章与第三、四章相对独立，可根据实际需求选择学习顺序。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 线性代数基础：矩阵运算、行列式、特征值\n- 微积分基础：导数、积分、Taylor 展开\n- 编程经验：能用 Python/MATLAB/Julia 等语言实现简单算法（本 hub 侧重原理，但理解需要编程直觉）\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [线性代数](../01_linear-algebra/)——第二章的理论基础，建议先掌握矩阵分解与特征值理论\n- [微分方程](../17_differential-equations/)——第四章的理论对应，了解解析解法有助于理解数值方法的近似本质\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-stability","title":"数值误差与稳定性","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/error-stability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"floating-point","title":"浮点数表示与运算","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/error-stability/floating-point"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-propagation","title":"误差传播","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/error-stability/error-propagation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-stability","title":"数值稳定性","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/error-stability/numerical-stability"},{"seq":4,"slug":"precision-pitfalls","title":"精度陷阱","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/error-stability/precision-pitfalls"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-algebra-methods","title":"线性代数数值方法","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/linear-algebra-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"direct-solvers","title":"直接求解法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/linear-algebra-methods/direct-solvers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iterative-solvers","title":"迭代求解法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/linear-algebra-methods/iterative-solvers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eigenvalue-algorithms","title":"特征值算法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/linear-algebra-methods/eigenvalue-algorithms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sparse-matrix","title":"稀疏矩阵","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/linear-algebra-methods/sparse-matrix"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-integration-differentiation","title":"数值积分与微分","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpolation","title":"插值方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation/interpolation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"numerical-differentiation","title":"数值微分","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation/numerical-differentiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quadrature-rules","title":"求积公式","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation/quadrature-rules"},{"seq":4,"slug":"adaptive-integration","title":"自适应积分","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation/adaptive-integration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ode-numerical","title":"常微分方程数值解","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/ode-numerical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"euler-methods","title":"欧拉方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/ode-numerical/euler-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"runge-kutta","title":"龙格-库塔方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/ode-numerical/runge-kutta"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stiff-equations","title":"刚性方程","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/ode-numerical/stiff-equations"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ode-applications","title":"常微分方程应用","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/numerical-methods/ode-numerical/ode-applications"}]}]}